                  <Gene-commentary_comment>
                    <Gene-commentary>
                      <Gene-commentary_type value="comment">254</Gene-commentary_type>
                      <Gene-commentary_text>Transcript Variant: This variant (3) contains an alternate splice site in the 5&apos; region, and it thus differs in its 5&apos; UTR and initiates translation from a downstream in-frame start codon, compared to variant 1. The encoded isoform (b) is shorter at the N-terminus, compared to isoform a.</Gene-commentary_text>
                    </Gene-commentary>
                  </Gene-commentary_comment>
                </Gene-commentary>
