    <Gene-commentary>
      <Gene-commentary_type value="generif">18</Gene-commentary_type>
      <Gene-commentary_text>Significantly lower levels of alpha-2-macroglobulin were found in the serum of patients with steroid-induced necrosis of the femoral head (SINFH) than in controls (P &lt; 0.05). Immunohistochemical staining and western blotting demonstrated that the expression of alpha-2-macroglobulin was significantly decreased in the necrotic area of SINFH patients (P &lt; 0.05).</Gene-commentary_text>
