    <Gene-commentary>
      <Gene-commentary_type value="generif">18</Gene-commentary_type>
      <Gene-commentary_text>The blood coagulation pathway may be a key regulatory network pathway contributing to the allergic inflammatory response in AR patients. A2M, which is regulated by STAT3, may be an important protein in the pathogenesis of allergic rhinitis in AR patients.</Gene-commentary_text>
      <Gene-commentary_refs>
